# Christ Is God — web env (copy to .env.local for dev; set in Vercel for prod).
# Every var below is OPTIONAL for the build: with them unset, the auth layer is
# dormant (sign-in UI hides, proxy is a no-op) and the site behaves exactly as it
# did before accounts existed. See AUTH-SETUP.md for how to obtain these.

# --- Supabase (Phase 4A: Accounts) -------------------------------------------
# Project URL + publishable/anon key from Supabase → Project Settings → API.
# Both are safe to expose to the browser (the anon/publishable key is public by
# design; Row-Level Security is what protects data).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Conversational engine (existing; see DEPLOY.md) -------------------------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEBATE_API=https://christisgod-service.onrender.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEBATE_TOKEN=

# --- Search Console / Bing verification (existing) ---------------------------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_SITE_VERIFICATION=
